<title>POLAND: Polish air carrier LOT sells PLN 25 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>Polish air carrier LOT sells PLN 25 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish air carrier LOT SA has sold the first 25-million-zloty tranche of its one-year, 100-million-zloty commercial paper programme, a newspaper reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The commercial papers have been directed to domestic and foreign institutional investors,&quot; Cezary Smarszczewski, an official at Pekao SA bank, the issue's dealer, told the daily Dziennik Prawa i Gospodarki.</p>
<p>Smarszczewski said one CP had a nominal value of 500,000 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
